+No response, source receipt, browser observation or download was invented.
+
+Normal staging exits 128 because Git cannot create `.git/index.lock` within the current
+filesystem boundary. No commit could be created; HEAD remains
+`30bed8e30cf07201124deee609a21f7f01e47735`. The latest source manifest and patch include
+all intended source, frontend, tests and documentation against that base; bundle checksums
